Bind Npc 21510 Zone 1 for karus
Bind Npc 11510 Zone 2 for elmorad
Quest 526 "[Descendant of Hero/Boss] Horrible Spoil"
    Journal for karus "You must get rid of Grendel by following [Captain] Fargo's order at Luferson Castle."
    Journal for elmorad "You must get rid of Grendel by following [Captain] Falkwine's order at El Morad Castle."
    Collect 1 of 910195000

Requires player level >= 60 and quest 525 is completed

Rewards
    Give 25000000 experience
    Give 150 np
    Give 2 of 900017000

On available
    Say "At last the final battle! Good luck master!"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    If player is karus
        Say "You are here <selfname>. Are you combat ready?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now, go and bring me he's right arm that symbolizes his power!\n\nDefeat Monster [Grendel] and bring it's right arm like [Captain] Fargo ordered."
    If player is elmorad
        Say "You are here <selfname>. Are you combat ready?"
        Topic "Tell me more..." do
            Show quest "Now, go and bring me he's right arm that symbolizes his power!\n\nDefeat Monster [Grendel] and bring it's right arm like [Captain] Falkwine ordered."

On in_progress
    Say "Didn't leave yet?"

On claimable
    If player is karus
        Show quest "Great! Luferson Castle is in peace once again!"
    If player is elmorad
        Show quest "Great! El Morad Castle is in peace once again!"
